{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14375","headline":"酬窦大闲居见寄 · 房孺复","name":"酬窦大闲居见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"来自三湘到五溪，青枫无树不猨啼。\n名慙竹使宦情少，路隔桃源归思迷。\n鵩鸟赋成知性命，鲤鱼书至恨暌携。\n烦君强着潘年比，骑省风流讵可齐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"房孺复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}